  "description": "The world is your sandbox with this steamroller of a Plus-tire MTB. Roll over and through obstacles with the first 27.5\" Plus and the first 1x10 equipped bike in the 2017 Haro MTB line. Kenda Havoc 27.5x2.8\" tires smooth out the bumps, while their wider contact patch with the ground gives greater traction, more efficient braking and increased confidence on rough terrain. The 1x drivetrain is easier to use, more reliable, lighter, and offers increased chain clearance for wider Plus tires. This is our best value model in the most modern bike spec, all designed to maximize your time on the trails.\nNew Haro Double Peak 27.5\" Plus 6000 Series alloy frame\nNew 14, 16, 18 & 20-inch sizes\n2017 HL Vaxa 866 HLO 27.5\" Plus fork w/ 120mm travel & hydraulic lockout, Boost Compatible\nNew FSA Comet Modular MegaExo crankset, 30T Megatooth Crmo Chainring\nShimano Deore RD-M615 rear derailleur w/ clutch\nSunRace CSMS3 11-40T 10-Speed cassette\nShimano Deore SL-M610 right shifter\nPivit alloy Light, 15mm riser handlebar, 680 to 720mm width\nWTB Werewolf grips and Rocket Sport saddle\nWeinmann U-32 Disc alloy double wall, 32mm wide rims\nTektro Auriga HD-M285 hydraulic, 180 / 160mm rotors\nKenda Havoc 27.5x2.8\" tires",
